import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 427 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alien Situation: The Tragedy of Demon Races Being Defined as Resources","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 427 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alien Situation: The Tragedy of Demon Races Being Defined as Resources","no":427,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Aliens","Demon Races","Resource-ification","Species Tragedy"],"related":["50-Myriad-Races Genealogy Overview","52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis","12-Life-Cycle System Detailed Explanation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0427_模块2-莽荒纪-异族处境-妖族被定义为资源的悲剧.md","filePath":"en/0427_模块2-莽荒纪-异族处境-妖族被定义为资源的悲剧.md"}'),o={name:"en/0427_模块2-莽荒纪-异族处境-妖族被定义为资源的悲剧.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,u){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-427-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-alien-situation-the-tragedy-of-demon-races-being-defined-as-resources" tabindex="-1">Entry 427 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alien Situation: The Tragedy of Demon Races Being Defined as Resources <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-427-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-alien-situation-the-tragedy-of-demon-races-being-defined-as-resources" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 427 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alien Situation: The Tragedy of Demon Races Being Defined as Resources&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 32) | Benchmark base: Documents 50, 52, 12</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-they-are-not-races-they-are-walking-medicine-herb-cabinets" tabindex="-1">Introduction: they are not races, they are walking medicine-herb cabinets <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-they-are-not-races-they-are-walking-medicine-herb-cabinets" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: they are not races, they are walking medicine-herb cabinets&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings&#39; equal evolution qualification. Manghuang world&#39;s aliens (demon tribes, alien beasts) have it worse than root-less mortals — mortals at least are still &quot;people&quot;; demon tribes are not even a race, only a &quot;body-refining material cabinet.&quot; Their existence&#39;s meaning is defined as &quot;being refined by human cultivators.&quot; This entry dissects this &quot;resource-ification&quot; tragedy. The law-first axiom is core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Demon races&#39; resource-ification energy waste is reducing an entire intelligent race to &quot;pill raw material&quot;: among demon tribes, clans that could have produced civilization, strong ones, independent cultivation systems, under the &quot;material&quot; definition are hunted to extinction. <strong>Treating intelligent races as a mine to dig equals burning an entire race&#39;s civilizational potential into a pot of decoction.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How demon-race resource-ification manufactures regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Ecology collapses</strong>: high-tier fierce beasts hunted; biosphere broken; even the natural circulation humankind survives on collapses</li><li><strong>Racial hatred</strong>: demon tribes long hunted; surely retaliate in great war; civilization internal friction</li><li><strong>Knowledge single</strong>: demon-tribe ecological wisdom, bloodline inheritance ignored; humankind cultivates one road alone</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind demon-race resource-ification is species-discrimination jurisprudence:</p><ul><li><strong>&quot;They are material&quot;</strong>: narrative from the start defines demon tribes as unintelligent, should-die, should-refine</li><li><strong>Human exception</strong>: all &quot;spiritual root,&quot; &quot;cultivation&quot; rules only apply to humans</li><li><strong>Ji Ning&#39;s dual-system superposition</strong>: he refines body by fierce beasts; equal to personally eating demon tribes as material</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Demon-Race Resource-ification</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alien View</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Demon tribes = body-refining material</td><td>Myriad-Races genealogy overview: demon tribes are equal evolution races</td></tr><tr><td>Hunting = cultivation</td><td>Life-cycle system: symbiotic cultivation; do not Dao-confirm by killing</td></tr><tr><td>Ecology collapses</td><td>Environmental-protection law: cultivation must not destroy biosphere</td></tr><tr><td>Racial hatred</td><td>Alien classification and symbiosis: classified policies, equal coexistence</td></tr><tr><td>Humankind cultivates one road alone</td><td>Myriad-Ranks differentiated cultivation paths; demon tribes have their own Dao</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate &quot;demon-race resource-ification&quot; vs. &quot;demon-race symbiosis&quot; two worlds</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: observe demon-race population survival rate, ecology integrity, humankind cultivation sustainability</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: high-tier fierce-beast populations, demon-race civilization index, humankind cultivation long-term supply</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under the resource-ification model demon races endangered within a century, ecological feedback dried up; under the symbiotic model humankind cultivation sustainable and ecology prosperous</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Manghuang demon-race setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Demon tribes&#39; &quot;intelligence level&quot; swings with plot; early mindless as beasts, late occasionally humanlike</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Demon-race combat strength redefined with protagonist leveling</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong></li></ul><p>Demon-race resource-ification also has a long-term consequence: it makes humankind lose the ability to dialogue with alien civilizations. Manghuang humans deal all their lives only with human cultivators; encountering demon tribes means fight; encountering aliens means kill. After several generations, humankind has not even grown the ability to negotiate with different civilizations. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad-Races republicanism is not only being kind to demon tribes, but training humankind itself — learning to symbiosize with different beings is itself a kind of cultivation. Treating aliens as material, humankind itself also degenerates dialogue ability.</p><p>Demon-race resource-ification also makes Manghuang lose its ecological stabilizer. Without demon-race balance, some species overflow, some species go extinct; the biosphere collapses on its own. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s environmental-protection law is not only being kind to demon tribes, but preserving the whole world&#39;s ecological base.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: intelligent-race potential burned into decoction</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: species-discrimination jurisprudence; demon tribes defined as material</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo did not treat alien beasts as pills; Manghuang body-refining writes demon tribes into the menu</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: demon tribes in Manghuang are not even a &quot;race&quot;</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a civilization of species discrimination lacks open vision</li></ul><p>Demon-race resource-ification also makes Manghuang lose a mirror. Human cultivators never reflect on their own cultivation way because they never dialogue with demon tribes — demon tribes are not dialogue partners, but prey. Without dialogue there is no reflection. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad-Races republicanism forces humankind to dialogue with demon tribes; the dialogue itself is an external test of humankind&#39;s cultivation way. Treating aliens as friends, humankind can see its own problems.</p><p>Respecting demon tribes is essentially respecting life&#39;s diversity. A civilization that does not even respect nearby lives, how can it talk about Myriad-Races republicanism. Demon tribes&#39; fate is the mirror of civilization&#39;s own cultivation.</p><p>Being kind to demon tribes is being kind to civilization&#39;s own ecological base.</p><p>Ecology&#39;s integrity is civilization&#39;s confidence.</p><p>Ecology steady, civilization&#39;s root steady.</p><p>Being kind to demon tribes is being kind to civilization&#39;s own ecological root; this step Manghuang never took.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>What Manghuang does most cruelly to demon tribes is not killing, but fundamentally not treating them as &quot;lives that can be killed.&quot; What Myriad-Races republicanism wants to do is release demon tribes from the medicine cabinet — let them also have qualification to cultivate, qualification to hate, qualification to build. A civilization that digs half its beings as a mine, the stronger the dirtier.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · alien situation · the tragedy of demon races being defined as resources described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./426_模块2-莽荒纪-平民处境-无灵根者的底层宿命.html">Entry 426 · Commoners&#39; Situation</a> · <a href="./419_模块2-莽荒纪-万族共和方案-打破人族本位与种族歧视.html">Entry 419 · Myriad-Races Republican Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad-Races Genealogy Overview</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
